CAMERA PLAN: Carry the previous episode breathing and water ambience into a side view of taking Ma Duo crank. At 3s track through the open north door to the bare spindle and shut the inlet. At 7s cut low to the drain stopper. At 10s make a clear elapsed-time cut to the lowered water mark, dry medicine crates and removal of the loosened copper plate. At 13s cut to the ladder interception. From 13s to 20s maintain a continuous side move from the guard blocking Wen Xi to Cen Lu presenting and signing the bond; finish when the pole is lowered. At 20s use an explicit cargo-inspection time ellipsis to custody transfer. At 24s cut to weighing and paying the wage purse. At 28s use a treatment time ellipsis: ointment already applied, then show the final palm-cloth turn and sliding the medical fee over two seconds.
TIMELINE:
[0–3s] Continue Ali's breath as water still enters through a wall gap; the pierced copper plate stays on the door. Then Lu Zhao crouches beside the soaked bound Ma Duo and unhooks the bronze crank from his belt; Ma Duo strains helplessly as it is taken away.
[3–7s] Inside the opened north room, the empty valve spindle and the bronze crank in Lu Zhao's hands share the frame. Then he seats the crank fully and presses it to its stop; incoming wall flow stops and falls to drops, with the crank remaining on the spindle.
[7–10s] Low close detail shows the drain plug, shallow water and channel sloping toward the low-tide outer river. Then Lu Zhao lifts the plug and water drains along the channel, exposing a corner of submerged planking.
[10–13s] Elliptical cut: water now lies two fingers below Lu Zhao's earlier scratch mark while the three survivors walk along the ledge. Dry third-tier medicine crates are visible through an existing gap behind two wet crates. Then Wen Xi removes the already loose copper plate from the open lock as she passes and slips it into Lu Zhao's belt pouch.
[13–16s] At the hatch, Wen Xi leads Ali and the grey-bearded worker; Lu Zhao follows holding Ma Duo's wrist tether, with his ankle rope removed after the time cut. A guard bars the hatch with a pole. Then merchant Cen Lu enters holding a cargo bond and stops before the pole.
[13.2–15.8s] 守船人, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “封舱！谁让出来的？”
[16–20s] Cen Lu presses her cargo bond against the blocking pole and signs to guarantee the three survivors. The guard reads her name. Then she moves her finger from her signature to the empty responsibility box for the sealed hold; he lowers the pole and signals his colleague to inspect the cargo and hear the survivors.
[16.2–19.6s] 岑鹿, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “活人我保。封舱损单，你签。”
[20–24s] After the cargo inspection time cut, the guard takes Ma Duo's wrist tether in front of all three survivors, with Lu Zhao at the side. Then Wen Xi identifies Ma Duo as the man who sealed them in and the guard orders his colleague to take him for questioning. Ma Duo looks back at the living witnesses as he is led out of frame.
[20.2–21.6s] 闻溪, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “他封的门。”
[21.9–23.4s] 守船人, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “带去问话。”
[24–28s] Cen Lu finishes weighing a purse next to a blank payment slip for post-composited 240-copper salvage wages. Then she places the heavy purse in Lu Zhao's hand; it drops under the weight, he tightens his grip and looks up as she turns to direct the cargo workers.
[24.3–27s] 岑鹿, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “二百四十。你的工钱。”
[28–30s] A treatment time cut: ointment has been applied and just the final bandage turn remains, with the dressing fee already on the table. Then Wen Xi tucks the cloth tail while Lu Zhao slides the fee closer; she looks up and nods as he withdraws the dressed hand.
Lu Zhao starts with bare palms. The RIGHT palm receives medicinal cloth at 28s. The new leather sheath is purchased in the following segment.
The original awl stays a single small hemp-handled tool. All characters preserve their reference identities across camera movements. End at the last specified action state at 30 seconds.
